WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.900
What do you usually do on Saturdays, Jessica?

2
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.230
Oh, that is a good question.

3
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.450
On Saturdays, I like simple things.

4
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.230
In the morning, I often walk in the park.

5
00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.760
Sometimes , I drink tea and enjoy the fresh air.

6
00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.610
It makes me feel calm and happy.

7
00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:39.110
That sounds very relaxing.

8
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.600
Yes, it is.

9
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.820
In the afternoon, I usually meet amy sister for lunch.

10
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:49.020
We talk and laugh a lot.

11
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.900
Sometimes we go shopping.

12
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.060
If it rains, I stay home and watch a movie.

13
00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:58.240
Movies are great.

14
00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:00.930
What do you usually do in the evening?

15
00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:03.510
In the evening, I stay at home.

16
00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:07.710
I listen to music or play video games.

17
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:12.120
I like to relax on Saturdays because the week is busy.

18
00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:13.460
Nice.

19
00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:15.070
How about you?

20
00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:18.260
What do you usually do on weekends, Alex?

21
00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:22.300
On weekends, I like to rest too.

22
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:24.800
In the morning, I sleep late.

23
00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:28.950
Then I make a big breakfast with eggs and bread.

24
00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:32.090
That sounds good.

25
00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:35.160
In the afternoon, I often meet my friends.

26
00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:38.620
We go to a small cafe and drink coffee.

27
00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.860
We talk about work and life.

28
00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:44.000
It is always nice to spend time together.

29
00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:46.550
That is great.

30
00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:49.240
In the evening, I cook dinner for my family.

31
00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.840
I like to try new food.

32
00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.210
Cooking makes me happy.

33
00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:57.310
It sounds like we both enjoy calm weekends.

34
00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.490
Yes, that is true.

35
00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.680
What do you usually do on Sunday evenings?

36
00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:06.590
On Sunday evenings, I prepare for the week.

37
00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:09.850
I clean my room and get my bag ready.

38
00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:13.060
It helps me feel ready for Monday.

39
00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:14.690
That is a good idea.

40
00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:19.010
Hey, maybe next Saturday we can go to a cafe together.

41
00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:22.020
Yes, that sounds nice!
